# 🏡 Smart Property Price Predictor

A professional real estate dashboard built using Streamlit.

## Features

- Property price prediction (ML model)
- Price vs Area comparison
- Market trend visualization
- Locality insights
- ROI projection
- Rental yield calculator
- Price breakdown
- Map visualization

## Run Locally

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python train_model.py
streamlit run app.py